{
  "id": "dialogue.mamimi.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "街边的她",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mamimi.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mamimi.first",
    "idolId": "mamimi",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "路过。倒是你，一直站在这家店门口。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "在看啊。反正也没别的地方去。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "大叔才是，盯着女孩子看，不太好吧ー？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，我只是觉得有点在意。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "在意？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……ふぅん。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "在意的话，就去别处在意吧。我还要继续发呆。"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（商店街……这时间人不多。）",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……嗯？橱窗前那个女孩，站了很久了。）",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……唔，好无聊啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……你在等人吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "……ん？",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "呼哇……大叔，你是谁啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（大叔……）不，我是制作人。283 Production 的。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "へぇー。283……就是那个事务所啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "mamimi",
        "text": "所以呢？大叔在这里做什么？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
